<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-15T06:01:58.620Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:01:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Bandits continue to assault northern states, killing soldiers in Zamfara and Borno and killing a traditional ruler in Plateau while rustling cattle. Gunmen also killed a Christian aid worker and a traditional ruler in Bokkos, and abducted CRIN workers who were later freed in Ibadan. Suspected bandits pushed into Niger’s Rijau community, forcing hundreds to flee, and advanced into Kaduna outskirts, prompting residents to abandon homes. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1HU3RuWFppRXNtbmRBUjFfSTEtOHZuemp2Z2V3aGdvY1A2U2pKMk8xOERPWGdWNWFuRk45Z2xUcUI5eGxBc2FsMDZTbFQtZldTTmdlNGp6MnhfemhVRHFlNktPclNNcVNGbDVlZjM0aTd2NlZZSzRsT2VRRy1Kdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNcGQweUxNcG5TZFdSczlUOXZpSUlfb05kRGlYOTJ0RzlvbGxZQnRsaWRSTHM1R1E2SXV4OUtEUl8xbTFhYXAzOFZ0bGE3eEpHcFM0cFZZUG9XTE0wU3pVYVhmT0xuc2NjSFUzX19QcG5QLXBKSmROZHFwSUFvOXZBLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chronicle NG&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNQ1RrM3g0ODJ6N0VCTldjWXZxeTc4SFJvS19kNnZTMUZGUldPU1A1R0tQcnhWT3pDTGxRd1E1ZkIzdFExdzE3VGlWWXlPOGtfM05GUm5PWk5ndV8yZzBkbk9pQTcwX2hxaTNrUmJnLVJEWWROZ0REYVNMZGVvS0dPNUU0TmxwdFd3bGREZk82SGRRMzVlckE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Report Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxONThFU2I3SmxoM2FublJjalZKazEtQzl1MlB6NFphWmFTb0dncTFObVVNNXY0bFp3V3FFMXZEdlA0U2tsNU1Pendldmc0Y180bk1zcmNjdkhLV1UyTUhOUGF4SGJ3QkdVQmh4X0wxLWRuTU4tUF9rTzByVXlJbDZpS2lfMmdua1lJU1RNSGQtSGVHbU8t?oc=5&quot;&gt;Premier Christian News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOUjdJVUN0d3J